445
00:44:36,674 --> 00:44:38,609
Oh! Ow!
No, Paula. Ow! Oh!

446
00:44:38,676 --> 00:44:41,112
- Ow! Oh! Oh!
- Paula!

447
00:44:41,179 --> 00:44:46,117
